msgid ""
"ArduPilot's master branch is missing throttle-slew-rate-limitting which is "
"present on 3DR's ArduPilot branch.  In the absence of a Green Cube this "
"makes flying ArduPilot-master on your Solo *very dangerous*."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot master 分支缺少 3DR ArduPilot 分支中存在的油门斜率限制功能。在没有 Green Cube 的情况下，在 "
"Solo 上运行 ArduPilot-master *非常危险*。"

