#: ../../source/docs/solo-opensolo-quickstart.rst:50
#: cdc7a18b218a409d8be9b7c5ef38b71a
msgid ""
"The /vagrant folder inside of the solo-builder ‘vagrant up’ VM is actually "
"the folder that you started the VM in ... 'solo-builder/' To get file/s out "
"of the 'VM\" you can ‘vagrant ssh’ into the VM and copy it to /vagrant and "
"exit the vm… alternatively… If you are on your solo's wifi, you can 'scp' "
"the file/s directly to your solo/artoo. ( see 'update solo' below )"
msgstr ""
"在 solo-builder 虚拟机（通过 vagrant up 启动）内的 /vagrant 文件夹实际上就是您启动虚拟机时所在的文件夹……即 "
"solo-builder/。要从虚拟机中取出文件，您可以用 vagrant ssh 登录虚拟机，将文件复制到 "
"/vagrant，然后退出虚拟机……或者，如果您已连接到 Solo 的 WiFi，也可以直接通过 scp 将文件传输到您的 "
"Solo/Artoo（见下方「更新 Solo」）。"

