msgid "Update Solo :"
msgstr "更新 Solo："

#: ../../source/docs/solo-opensolo-quickstart.rst:88
#: 1a80ee5166814ee2a25fd048fdfe5e88
msgid ""
"If you have not SSH'd into your Solo before and changed things, you may be "
"propted for a ssh password when doing 'ssh' or 'scp' commands. The 'root' "
"password to use is 'TjSDBkAu'.  more details here: "
"https://dev.3dr.com/starting-network.html Two reboots of Solo may be "
"required Your LED colours will be different that you are used to. Red "
"cycling during first reboot, rainbow cycling during second reboot. maybe. "
"ssh can take some time to be available after a reflash, be patient, wait "
"another minute."
msgstr ""
"如果您之前未通过 SSH 登录过 Solo 并进行过更改，执行 ssh 或 scp 命令时可能会提示输入 SSH 密码，root 密码为 "
"TjSDBkAu。详情见：https://dev.3dr.com/starting-network.html。Solo 可能需要重启两次。LED "
"颜色与平时不同：第一次重启时为红色循环，第二次重启时可能为彩虹循环。刷机后 SSH 可能需要一段时间才能可用，请耐心等待，再多等一分钟。"

